{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53762","headline":"同崔十八宿龙门兼寄令狐尚书冯常侍 · 白居易","name":"同崔十八宿龙门兼寄令狐尚书冯常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水碧玉磷磷，龙门秋胜春。\n山中一夜月，海内两闲人。\n等是幽栖伴，俱非富贵身。\n尚书与常侍，不可得相亲。\n（见前书卷五七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}